# Phasing out is no leaving the battlefield (CR 702.26d): Teferi's Protection's ruling, "Any one-shot effects that are waiting
# 'until [this] leaves the battlefield,' such as that of Banishing Light, won't happen when a permanent phases out." Bot1's
# Oblivion Ring exiles Bot2's Ornithopter, and Teferi's Protection phases the Ring out with the rest of Bot1's permanents: the
# Ornithopter stays in exile. As Bot1's turn 5 begins the Ring phases in without entering, so its "When this enchantment
# enters" asks for no target, and the Ornithopter is still in exile.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Sapphire
Oblivion Ring
Teferi's Protection
Plains
Plains
Plains x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Ornithopter
Island x20

